[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10986.55, "timestamp": "03:03:06", "text": "但还有这类音乐视频和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10991.269, "timestamp": "03:03:11", "text": "现在做什么都要花很多钱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10994.23, "timestamp": "03:03:14", "text": "是的。音乐也算是某种……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10995.99, "timestamp": "03:03:15", "text": "你管它叫什么？这些乐器太……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10997.75, "timestamp": "03:03:17", "text": "昂贵的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11006.07, "timestamp": "03:03:26", "text": "是的，即使是用数字方式制作的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11008.389, "timestamp": "03:03:28", "text": "但当他们这样做时，例如，C"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11010.95, "timestamp": "03:03:30", "text": "当她举办演唱会时，情况就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11013.83, "timestamp": "03:03:33", "text": "他们会把活人带进来，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11016.309, "timestamp": "03:03:36", "text": "就像现场钢琴家、吉他手一样，他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11019.03, "timestamp": "03:03:39", "text": "现在还得玩。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11023.03, "timestamp": "03:03:43", "text": "好像这就是问题的关键。哇。太疯狂了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11024.79, "timestamp": "03:03:44", "text": "他们如何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11027.67, "timestamp": "03:03:47", "text": "保持专注，注意所有这些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11030.15, "timestamp": "03:03:50", "text": "东西。这些人又将如何呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11034.55, "timestamp": "03:03:54", "text": "玩耍时要让它们都包含在每一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11037.11, "timestamp": "03:03:57", "text": "这些歌曲。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11039.51, "timestamp": "03:03:59", "text": "只是想看看我很久以前是如何处理的。"}]